Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.08,0:01:53.21,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(420,0)\pos(284,125)}第4旅 呼 BY ZHE SEA
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.97,0:23:40.98,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(640,210)}下集
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.97,0:23:40.98,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(640,480)}烏鴉&龍&蕎麥&離島
Comment: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:01.00,Comment,,0,0,0,,——Text——
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.82,0:00:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,好多人啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.25,0:01:59.18,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\fad(420,420)\fn方正粗圆_GBK\bord2\fs23\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\pos(640,630)\b0}作品內登場的地點·費用·名稱等可能與實際不同。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.25,0:01:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,725)}和師父還有師父的朋友  三人旅行?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.96,0:02:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,725)}嗯  你就別叫我師父了  我可不敢當
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.64,0:02:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,師父就是師父啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.68,0:02:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,那冬姐你的朋友是…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.68,0:02:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,她和我在不同雜誌上連載
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.60,0:02:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,也是漫畫家  目前在找助手
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.15,0:02:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我覺得吧  要是能在旅行中處好關係
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.65,0:02:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,說不定就更容易開展工作了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.61,0:02:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,小千除了我這裡  應該還在找助手的工作吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.41,0:02:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,這也是好機會
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.08,0:02:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.00,0:02:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,然後  我就來了這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.75,0:02:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,去裡面人應該會少點吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.22,0:02:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,在新幹線上完全沒能和師父這位漫畫家朋友搭上話呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.72,0:02:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,真不錯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.48,0:02:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,天空橋莉莉小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.90,0:02:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,對了  這次的問卷選項還是天空橋小姐提議的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.94,0:03:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼會是這4個選項呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.23,0:03:02.16,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\fs20\b0\an7\c&H000000&\3c&HFFFFFF&\fad(966,0)}要和一直提供我漫畫助手工作的師父一起去旅行了\N提出了幾個府縣  不知道該怎麼分類\N從東京出發去哪裡好呢?\N\N出發去京都了\N\N能和師父一起旅行  好開心\N\N在漫畫中畫陰天好困擾啊\N\N天氣有點陰  但有陽光灑下  會是個好天氣\N\N要是旅行時天氣這樣該有多好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.62,0:03:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.20,0:03:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,打擾一下  天空橋小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.95,0:03:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,那個問卷…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.50,0:03:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,小  小千  莉莉  等等我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.42,0:03:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,終於趕上了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.67,0:03:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,糀谷冬音老師
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.63,0:03:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你這體力也太差了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.72,0:03:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,這有什麼關係  天空橋莉莉老師
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.10,0:03:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,只要能開發出超人血清
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.22,0:03:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,絕對能四肢強壯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.06,0:03:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,四肢強壯的冬姐…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.27,0:03:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,對了鈴森同學
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.85,0:03:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,天空橋叫起來很拗口吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.73,0:03:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,叫我莉莉就好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.03,0:03:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.40,0:03:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,叫莉莉醬才好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.45,0:03:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,感覺亮晶晶的  很可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.99,0:03:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,行了行了  冬音  走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.24,0:03:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,等等我  等等我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.79,0:03:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,這種大人的感覺好帥啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.79,0:03:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣走起來很困難啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.21,0:03:56.63,Comment,,0,0,0,,還有就是  總覺得在哪裡見過
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.21,0:03:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,明明你就很開心啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.42,0:04:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,啊呀  錯過問問卷的事了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.43,0:04:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,這個千本鳥居真的有1000個嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.93,0:04:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,千本鳥居只是最開始走的那點
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.64,0:04:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,要是算上伏見稻荷全部的  得有10000個了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.86,0:04:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,到這裡正好有2750個
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.78,0:04:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,師父  你還數了啊?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.11,0:04:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你可別信她
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.91,0:04:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,感覺空氣都變了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.04,0:04:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,伏見稻荷大社內部
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.63,0:04:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,有受人供奉的小神龕「塚」10000個左右
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.34,0:04:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,也被稱為「塚信仰」
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.26,0:04:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,為塚供奉鳥居應該是從江戶時代開始的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.48,0:04:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,這看起來都有點可怕了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.15,0:04:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,人們思念停留的場所…啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.40,0:05:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,感覺有什麼要湧出來了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.32,0:05:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,鳥居的存在因其能收穫人類的思念
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.28,0:05:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,才沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.70,0:05:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,要是這些思念能融為一體
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.00,0:05:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣的  說不定能用上
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.05,0:05:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,師父這樣的妄想能力
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.72,0:05:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,原來連載漫畫就是這樣誕生的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.14,0:05:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,得好好學習才行
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.55,0:05:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,這也太荒唐了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.81,0:05:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,這種程度才正好嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.93,0:05:35.39,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\c&H000000&\bord0\pos(572.8,112.4)}距山頂40分鐘!!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.64,0:05:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,40分鐘…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.44,0:05:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼辦啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.90,0:05:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,快走!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.82,0:05:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你等等
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.82,0:05:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.23,0:06:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,一會上一會下  走了挺多路的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.11,0:06:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,還真是爬山啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.53,0:06:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,「重輕石」?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.41,0:06:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,拿起石頭  要是比預料中輕  願望就會實現
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.58,0:06:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,要試試嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.55,0:06:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,希望我能成為獨當一面的漫畫家
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.18,0:06:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,好重…不對  好輕?  應該是哪個?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.85,0:06:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,好輕啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.44,0:07:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你許了什麼願?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.19,0:07:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,希望下次的原稿能在截稿日前完成
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.23,0:07:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,願望好簡單!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.12,0:07:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,看起來好好吃!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.41,0:07:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,去吃點甜的嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.92,0:07:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,在適度的疲勞之後
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.42,0:07:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,好喝
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.26,0:07:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,咕咚咕咚?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.72,0:07:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,莉莉  不是說好3個人一起乾杯的嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.35,0:07:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.31,0:07:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,一離開神社  不自覺就…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.69,0:07:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你在喝什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.44,0:07:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,是松本酒造的「桃滴」
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.03,0:07:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼是一副理所當然的表情?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.86,0:07:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,好率直的眼神
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.91,0:07:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,這是…酒?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.99,0:07:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,口感清爽  是京都本地的酒
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.79,0:08:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,京都這附近  伏見地區是酒藏之街
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.75,0:08:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,那邊是松本酒藏
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.96,0:08:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,那邊是月桂冠
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.00,0:08:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,就是說  那…這個…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.59,0:08:07.59,Comment,,0,0,0,,藤岡酒造!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.42,0:08:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,順帶一提  問卷的選項是日本酒產量最高的4縣
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.51,0:08:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,這是女生3人的日本酒尋酒之旅哦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.76,0:08:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,沒錯  就讓我們敞開心扉好好聊聊吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.18,0:08:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.90,0:08:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.98,0:08:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你之前不是說過生日  現在也已經是大學二年級了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.74,0:08:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不應該是20歲了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.32,0:08:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我出生早  3月份滿19歲
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.41,0:08:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,對…對不起  小千  是我誤會了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.12,0:08:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,不用在意
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.96,0:08:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,就算不能喝酒  京都也是個好地方
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.67,0:08:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.63,0:08:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,快點趕上來吧  小妹妹
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.06,0:09:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,這話說的挺好  但說的是喝酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.93,0:09:08.44,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\fn@萝莉体-DDC.yolan\fs50\bord4\fsp5\c&H1716FF&\3c&HFFFFFF&\frz259.3\pos(556.8,430.266)}帥氣的成年女性
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.14,0:09:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,真不錯  你是哪所中學的?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.31,0:09:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,十中
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.81,0:09:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,這…印象都被…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.02,0:09:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,很好  你們倆快跟我去下個地方吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.49,0:09:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,得小心別變成那樣的大人了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.28,0:09:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,還有就是別扯上…嗯?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.16,0:09:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,這種感覺  之前也…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.25,0:09:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,對了  是在會津的旅店獨自喝酒的那個人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.26,0:09:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,對了對了  莉莉有給我看過小千的問卷旅行
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.05,0:09:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,說是這人在做好玩的事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.39,0:09:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,然後就…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.97,0:09:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,會津啊  那裡好像有好喝的日本酒
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.85,0:09:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,然後馬上就旅行去了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.81,0:09:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,原來你們這麼靠近過啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.94,0:09:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,居然還有這種事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.11,0:09:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,都好喝
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.53,0:09:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,「山海膽豆腐」是什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.03,0:09:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,要嚐嚐嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.28,0:10:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,這道料理是將豆腐用味曾進行醃製
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.37,0:10:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,有海膽的口感
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.87,0:10:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,口感的確和海膽好像啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.08,0:10:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,是味曾味的?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.25,0:10:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,太下酒了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.25,0:10:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不過有點可惜了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.76,0:10:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,2人偶然在旅行地相遇  然後關係逐漸融洽
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.01,0:10:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,「我們都是朋友」
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.89,0:10:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我就這樣妄想了一下
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.43,0:10:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,好有漫畫的感覺啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.48,0:10:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,這是什麼鬼?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.35,0:10:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,然後演變為三角關係
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.94,0:10:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,感覺能一次畫完啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.86,0:10:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,都在考慮漫畫  不愧是師父
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.13,0:11:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,已經傍晚了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.60,0:11:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,得找住的地方了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.27,0:11:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,找有日本酒溫泉的旅館吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.40,0:11:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼說的好像想到了什麼好主意似的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.11,0:11:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼可能有這種地方
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.32,0:11:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,彷彿是日本古神話一樣的旅館…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.49,0:11:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,老婆子  院子裡有酒冒出來了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.91,0:11:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,沒錯沒錯  就是這樣的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.00,0:11:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,又在喝了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.33,0:11:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,對了小千  我已經預約旅館了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.67,0:11:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.76,0:11:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,京都人流量很大  要是沒地方住就麻煩了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.22,0:11:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,的確如此
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.68,0:11:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,平常的雜感有變淡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.98,0:11:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,有種大人旅行的感覺也不錯呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.10,0:11:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,而且明天還有地方想去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.94,0:11:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,就訂了那附近的旅館
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.40,0:12:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,那是距離京都站電車2小時左右的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.11,0:12:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然不雜  但有點太粗暴了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.03,0:12:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,話說那應該不在東京吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.24,0:12:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,不是的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.21,0:12:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.29,0:12:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,也喜歡在電車上喝酒
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.96,0:12:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,沒人問你這個啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.34,0:12:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,去的時候我會忍著
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.01,0:12:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你很努力了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.47,0:12:28.68,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\fn@方正行楷_GBK\fs55\frz270\bord3\3c&H000000&\c&HFAFAFA&\pos(1257.6,294.8)}城崎特快列車
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.64,0:12:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,先坐上城崎特快列車
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.89,0:12:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,在福知山站換乘京都丹後鐵道丹後海號
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.38,0:12:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,到宮津了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.47,0:13:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,原來如此
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.14,0:13:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,莉莉小姐  我們走了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.52,0:13:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,狸貓可是好酒館的證明哦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.03,0:13:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,在這邊吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.20,0:13:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,到了  這裡就是…今晚住的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.41,0:13:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,真不錯呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.00,0:13:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,很有旅行的感覺吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.50,0:13:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,花2個小時來這裡也值了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.88,0:13:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,感覺有好喝的酒在等著我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.38,0:13:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,還真是毫不動搖啊  喝過第一口後就這樣…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.89,0:13:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,不過這種看起來很不錯的旅館  價錢應該也…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.93,0:13:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,沒事的沒事的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.18,0:13:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,這次是我隨意訂的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.19,0:13:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,費用就包姐姐身上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.36,0:14:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,姐姐!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.52,0:14:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,莉莉可不一樣!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.45,0:14:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,歡迎光臨  已經恭候多時了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.70,0:14:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,承蒙照顧了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.41,0:14:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,餐食已經準備好了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.16,0:14:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,房子很不錯呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.00,0:14:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝誇獎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.84,0:14:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,這裡從明治時期就開始不斷改建
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.46,0:14:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,才有了現在這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.09,0:14:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,歷史  好棒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.55,0:14:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,房間在這邊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.60,0:14:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,好棒的和室啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.97,0:14:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,房間裡就有浴室
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.31,0:14:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,溫泉也已經準備好了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.64,0:14:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,請慢慢來
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.94,0:14:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.36,0:14:43.07,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\fnFZLanTingYuan-B-GBK\fs35\bord2\c&H3938CF&\3c&HEEFCF8&\pos(629.74,378.92)}1晚住宿加2餐 海鮮暢享套餐 約16000日元!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.36,0:14:43.07,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\fn@DFHannotateW7-A\fs70\c&H2E2E45&\3c&HEDFDFD&\frz270\bord3\pos(1269.866,220.285)}房間布局
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.36,0:14:43.07,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\fnDFHannotateW7-A\fs35\c&H3F414D&\3c&HEFFDFA&\bord2\pos(273.739,541.194)}冰箱
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.36,0:14:43.07,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\fn@DFHannotateW7-A\frz270\fs40\c&H3F414D&\3c&HEFFDFA&\bord2\pos(133.887,319.564)}全身鏡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.36,0:14:43.07,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\fnDFHannotateW7-A\fs30\c&H3F414D&\3c&HEFFDFA&\bord2\pos(318.184,254.379)}壁櫥
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.36,0:14:43.07,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\fnDFHannotateW7-A\fs30\c&H3F414D&\3c&HEFFDFA&\bord2\pos(621.198,76.547)}浴室\N廁所\N盥洗室
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.36,0:14:43.07,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\fnDFHannotateW7-A\fs35\c&H3F414D&\3c&HEFFDFA&\bord2\pos(664.776,263.49)}寬廊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.36,0:14:43.07,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\fnDFHannotateW7-A\fs40\c&H3F414D&\3c&HEFFDFA&\bord2\pos(772.628,6.972)}神秘門
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.36,0:14:43.07,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\fnDFHannotateW7-A\fs30\c&H3F414D&\3c&HEFFDFA&\bord2\pos(748.095,92.039)\b1}洗臉台
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.36,0:14:43.07,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\fnDFHannotateW7-A\fs30\c&H3F414D&\3c&HEFFDFA&\bord2\pos(1053.295,346.971)}壺
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.36,0:14:43.07,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\fnDFHannotateW7-A\fs30\c&H3F414D&\3c&HEFFDFA&\bord2\pos(1094.628,428.972)}掛軸
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.72,0:15:13.98,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\fn@FZLanTingYuan-DB-GBK\frz270\c&HA1A1A1&\3c&H313237&\pos(1228.952,344.476)\bord1.5}女浴室
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.86,0:14:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,這裡也不錯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.40,0:14:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,真不錯  我喜歡這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.15,0:14:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,旅館加上這裡  等於文豪  對吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.87,0:14:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我懂
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.53,0:14:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,用溫泉…熱酒?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.41,0:14:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣太危險  不可以哦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.19,0:15:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,這是怎麼回事  也太合適了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.23,0:15:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不會太熱也不會太冷  絕妙啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.20,0:15:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,冬姐  都化了?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.66,0:15:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,很好  洗完澡後得來一杯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.29,0:15:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,還要喝啊?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.91,0:15:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,等…莉莉小姐!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.25,0:15:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,冬姐!!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.97,0:15:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,天亮了…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.57,0:16:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,文豪?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.82,0:16:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,早啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.66,0:16:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,在做什麼啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.58,0:16:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,趁我清醒的時候  把想到的內容都記下來
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.87,0:16:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,畫好可愛啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.34,0:16:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然冬音說過  只要想到的就不會忘記
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.13,0:16:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我是覺得  稍微錯過一點都很可惜
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.22,0:16:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣的努力一定和連載直接相關
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.10,0:16:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不過話說起來  這裡可真好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.61,0:16:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,感覺總有一天能和出色的男性相遇
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.94,0:16:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,開玩笑的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.03,0:16:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,好少女啊  真沒想到
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.91,0:16:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,真敢說啊  我可是少女漫畫家哦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.58,0:17:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,莉莉小姐?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.00,0:17:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我早就決定在旅行的時候絕不手下留情
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.96,0:17:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,對自己的肝臟
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.96,0:17:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,還沒有打開哦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.34,0:17:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,這話能用來耍帥的時候說嗎?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.47,0:17:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,千花還挺會吐槽
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.10,0:17:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,這還是頭一次有人這麼說
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.84,0:17:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,這裡…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.26,0:17:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,景色好壯觀  好大啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.84,0:17:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,小千  你的詞彙…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.81,0:18:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,真不錯啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.47,0:18:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,莉莉小姐  你在做什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.56,0:18:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,把美好的景色融入酒中就會變得很好喝
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.56,0:18:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你不知道嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.44,0:18:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.19,0:18:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,這人真的是…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.74,0:18:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,一看到這裡的景色
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.25,0:18:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣也不錯  很好!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.33,0:18:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,師父的妄想能力!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.29,0:18:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,沒有心動啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.59,0:18:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,又把頭髮弄這麼亂
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.38,0:18:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,快看啊  那裡有「胯下窺視台」
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.18,0:18:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,會被偷窺裙底嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.93,0:18:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,貌似是從胯下窺視
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.15,0:18:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,血上頭了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.53,0:18:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,說是頭腦充血暈暈乎乎的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.57,0:19:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,能讓天橋立看起來更加的夢幻
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.49,0:19:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,醉酒後做出這種行為是很危險的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.25,0:19:14.25,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs35\bord2\c&H000000&\b0\3c&HE8E8DE&}開始連載
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.25,0:19:15.71,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs35\bord2\c&H000000&\b0\3c&HE8E8DE&}可以再版
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.71,0:19:17.67,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs35\bord2\c&H000000&\b0\3c&HE8E8DE&}想喝美酒
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.13,0:19:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.26,0:19:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,好誒
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.05,0:19:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,成了!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.48,0:19:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,那就去走一圈天橋立吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.15,0:19:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,嗷
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.32,0:19:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.03,0:19:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,有個大叔…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.87,0:19:45.33,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\fn@DFHannotateW7-A\fs70\c&H63437E&\3c&HFBFBFA&\frz270\bord4\pos(1273.066,308.666)}隨性地圖
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.87,0:19:45.33,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\fnFZLanTingYuan-B-GBK\fs35\c&H194FBA&\3c&HFBFBFA&\bord2\pos(777.295,415.365)}開始地點
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.87,0:19:45.33,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\fnFZLanTingYuan-B-GBK\fs30\c&H1C75F1&\3c&HFBFBFA&\bord2\b0\pos(397.562,658.108)}剛才的展望台
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.61,0:20:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,這是什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.27,0:20:30.95,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fn方正行楷_GBK\fs30\c&HFAFAFA&\bord1.5\3c&H000000&}岩見重太郎復仇之所
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.27,0:20:30.95,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fn方正楷体_GBK\fs25\c&H333D39&\bord2\3c&HD5DEE4&\b1}\N劍豪  岩見重太郎\N\N{\fs20\bord1.5}岩見重太郎是故事中非常有名的傳說中的劍豪\N據說是活躍在江戶時代初期\N重太郎為了追擊父親的仇人廣瀨軍藏·鳴尾權藏·\N大川八左衛門來到了宮津  三名仇人被藩主京極家\N所藏匿  最終經藩主允許  於天橋立濃松之地斬殺\N三人  達成所願\N此外  還留下了重太郎斬斷了每晚襲擊天橋立行人\N元伊勢籠神社的石獅子的腳阻止其夜行的傳說\N\N\N宮津旋轉俱樂部50周年紀念\N宮津市制  50周年紀念  2004年10月建立
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.86,0:20:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,名為岩見重太郎的傳說中的劍豪
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.11,0:20:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,在此為父親報仇
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.49,0:20:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,斬斷夜晚暴亂的神社的石獅子前腳
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.49,0:20:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,並將之制服
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.74,0:20:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,這是什麼  也太帥了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.58,0:20:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,感覺應該可以畫成漫畫
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.58,0:20:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,應該會有重太郎這款日本酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.43,0:20:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,By the sea  太可愛了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.10,0:20:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,元伊勢籠神社
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.32,0:21:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,有史記錄以來  豐受大神就在此接受供奉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.78,0:21:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,此外  天照大神貌似也在此一同供奉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.28,0:21:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,現如今  兩位神明都被供奉在三重縣的伊勢神宮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.29,0:21:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,因而有了元伊勢之名
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.58,0:21:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,真是讓人覺得不虛此行的好神社啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.84,0:21:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.25,0:21:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你們快來看石獅子的腳
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.88,0:21:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,前腳被砍斷了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.72,0:21:29.69,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fn方正楷体_GBK\fs30\c&H333D39&\bord2\3c&H6C7D77&\pos(841.79,585.067)}斬斷了石獅的腳
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.89,0:21:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,在大阪制服了狒狒
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.64,0:21:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,岩見重太郎  這也太厲害了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.07,0:21:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,那就去參拜一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.78,0:21:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.82,0:21:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,等等我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.18,0:22:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,來了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.97,0:22:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,知道了知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.48,0:22:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,莉莉小姐  早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.02,0:22:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,早
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.06,0:22:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,今天開始就多多關照了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.57,0:22:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,請多多關照
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.69,0:22:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,咦  戴眼鏡了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.45,0:22:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,在家就會戴著
Comment: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:01.06,Comment,,0,0,0,,
